      <section id="process">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Four phases, one workload, a clear handover</h2>
          <p>Every sprint follows the same four steps and ends with a handoff to your team.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid process">
          <div class="step">
            <h4>Assess</h4>
            <p>We review the workload, pipeline, controls and spend, and agree what success looks like.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <h4>Improve</h4>
            <p>We build the fixes in your environment, through your pipelines, as code.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <h4>Validate</h4>
            <p>We test them: failed-release and recovery exercises, control checks, cost baselines.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <h4>Transfer</h4>
            <p>Runbooks, walkthroughs and a backlog of next steps, so your team owns the result.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
